      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is a good idea, so long as it's able to be set by the user. There are some edge cases I can think of that would make sense to calculate through walls. Such as having an avatar that's a table of plushies - the plushies can be moved from the source location and posed in a spot via physbones.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
